    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369480/extras/c0e29983cf2a1c3f14d438dccde18303.avif?t=1750442399\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>GNOMONIC</strong></i><strong> - The Art RPG!</strong> In this <strong>ART-PG</strong>, walk through <strong>watercolor paintings</strong>, fight in <strong>real-time projectile battles</strong>, solve <strong>puzzles </strong>with shadows, meet <strong>friends </strong>with creative talents in <strong>worlds</strong> themed by artistic mediums<strong>, </strong>and discover a <strong>story about how we experience art</strong>... <br>and <strong>how art experiences us</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shoot equipped projectiles down lanes to simultaneously attack and defend!</strong> Every enemy-type has unique attacks and their own battlefields, from projectiles that jump between lanes or burrow underground to battlefield orientations with more to manage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize how you battle with Stuff that you can equip to three projectile slots, Specials that allow you to use one powerful ability, and Dials that provide passive effects!</strong> Find them dropped around the world or dropped by defeated enemies, allowing you to use enemy projectiles and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cast your shadow over objects for special interactions and puzzle solving!</strong> And discover new abilities that will allow you to traverse new obstacles and solve more puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Throughout it all, a prophecy persists: \u201cLIGHT will unite with SHADE and free the GNOMON.\u201d But... \ud835\ude86\ud835\ude91\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude9d \ud835\ude92\ud835\ude9c \ud835\ude8a \ud835\ude76\ud835\ude7d\ud835\ude7e\ud835\ude7c\ud835\ude7e\ud835\ude7d?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369480/extras/c0e29983cf2a1c3f14d438dccde18303.avif?t=1750442399\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>GNOMONIC</strong></i><strong> - The Art RPG!</strong> In this <strong>ART-PG</strong>, walk through <strong>watercolor paintings</strong>, fight in <strong>real-time projectile battles</strong>, solve <strong>puzzles </strong>with shadows, meet <strong>friends </strong>with creative talents in <strong>worlds</strong> themed by artistic mediums<strong>, </strong>and discover a <strong>story about how we experience art</strong>... <br>and <strong>how art experiences us</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shoot equipped projectiles down lanes to simultaneously attack and defend!</strong> Every enemy-type has unique attacks and their own battlefields, from projectiles that jump between lanes or burrow underground to battlefield orientations with more to manage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize how you battle with Stuff that you can equip to three projectile slots, Specials that allow you to use one powerful ability, and Dials that provide passive effects!</strong> Find them dropped around the world or dropped by defeated enemies, allowing you to use enemy projectiles and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cast your shadow over objects for special interactions and puzzle solving!</strong> And discover new abilities that will allow you to traverse new obstacles and solve more puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Throughout it all, a prophecy persists: \u201cLIGHT will unite with SHADE and free the GNOMON.\u201d But... \ud835\ude86\ud835\ude91\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude9d \ud835\ude92\ud835\ude9c \ud835\ude8a \ud835\ude76\ud835\ude7